# Local editor and OS files
.DS_Store

# Per-run scratch written by the agent tooling: gathered copies of other
# repositories' files, and the task briefs handed to delegated workers. Neither
# is source. A committed gather copy makes this repository's code search answer
# with another repository's details, and a worker brief is already summarized by
# the commit it produced.
#
# The two config files beside these directories are NOT ignored on purpose:
# .cortexkit/alfonso.jsonc chooses where this repository's delegated workers
# run, and .cortexkit/WORKER.md is the instruction file every one of them
# receives. Both change how work is done here, so they are reviewed and
# versioned like any other config.
.cortexkit/alfonso/context/
.cortexkit/alfonso/prompts/
.cortexkit/magic-context/
